#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:4
msgid "运动模糊"
msgstr "Motion Blur"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:6
msgid ""
"JAnim 支持对物件开启时域运动模糊（temporal motion blur）：渲染一帧时， 在快门时间区间内渲染多个时刻的完整场景并取平均。 高"
"速运动的物件会因此拉出与真实相机快门一致的拖影。"
msgstr ""
"JAnim supports **temporal motion blur** for items: instead of sampling a single instant, each frame renders the "
"**complete scene** at several moments within the shutter interval and averages them. Fast-moving items therefore leave "
"trails that match a real camera shutter — this is true shutter accumulation, not a post-processing smear."

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:12
msgid "运动模糊默认不对任何物件生效，需要显式调用 :meth:`~.Item.set_motion_blur` 开启。"
msgstr "Motion blur is not enabled for any item by default; call :meth:`~.Item.set_motion_blur` explicitly to turn it on."

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:15
msgid "快速上手"
msgstr "Quick Start"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:20
msgid ""
"from janim.imports import *\n"
"\n"
"class MotionBlurBasic(Timeline):\n"
"    CONFIG = Config(fps=30, motion_blur_samples=16, motion_blur_shutter=8)\n"
"\n"
"    def construct(self) -> None:\n"
"        blurred = Square(0.8, fill_color=BLUE, fill_alpha=1, stroke_alpha=0)\n"
"        blurred.set_motion_blur().show()\n"
"        blurred.points.shift(LEFT * 2 + UP * 1.2)\n"
"\n"
"        sharp = Square(0.8, fill_color=RED, fill_alpha=1, stroke_alpha=0).show()\n"
"        sharp.points.shift(LEFT * 2 - UP * 1.2)\n"
"\n"
"        Text('set_motion_blur()', font_size=26, color=BLUE).points.move_to([0, 2.6, 0]).r.show()\n"
"        Text('default: no blur', font_size=26, color=RED).points.move_to([0, -2.6, 0]).r.show()\n"
"\n"
"        self.play(\n"
"            blurred.anim(rate_func=linear).points.shift(RIGHT * 4),\n"
"            sharp.anim(rate_func=linear).points.shift(RIGHT * 4),\n"
"            duration=1.6,\n"
"        )"
msgstr ""
"from janim.imports import *\n"
"\n"
"class MotionBlurBasic(Timeline):\n"
"    CONFIG = Config(fps=30, motion_blur_samples=16, motion_blur_shutter=8)\n"
"\n"
"    def construct(self) -> None:\n"
"        blurred = Square(0.8, fill_color=BLUE, fill_alpha=1, stroke_alpha=0)\n"
"        blurred.set_motion_blur().show()\n"
"        blurred.points.shift(LEFT * 2 + UP * 1.2)\n"
"\n"
"        sharp = Square(0.8, fill_color=RED, fill_alpha=1, stroke_alpha=0).show()\n"
"        sharp.points.shift(LEFT * 2 - UP * 1.2)\n"
"\n"
"        Text('set_motion_blur()', font_size=26, color=BLUE).points.move_to([0, 2.6, 0]).r.show()\n"
"        Text('default: no blur', font_size=26, color=RED).points.move_to([0, -2.6, 0]).r.show()\n"
"\n"
"        self.play(\n"
"            blurred.anim(rate_func=linear).points.shift(RIGHT * 4),\n"
"            sharp.anim(rate_func=linear).points.shift(RIGHT * 4),\n"
"            duration=1.6,\n"
"        )"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:50
msgid "参考："
msgstr "See also:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:52
msgid ":meth:`~.Item.set_motion_blur` :meth:`~.Item.is_motion_blur_enabled`"
msgstr ":meth:`~.Item.set_motion_blur` :meth:`~.Item.is_motion_blur_enabled`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:22
msgid "其中两个方块的运动完全相同，唯一的区别是上方方块调用了 ``set_motion_blur()``："
msgstr ""
"Both squares perform exactly the same motion; the only difference is that the upper one calls ``set_motion_blur()``:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:24
msgid "开模糊的方块在每个时间样本中的位置都不同，采样再平均后就成了一条拖影；"
msgstr ""
"The blurred square occupies a different position in every time sample, so averaging them turns it into a single trail;"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:25
msgid "未开启的方块则被固定在帧中心时刻，因此始终清晰锐利。"
msgstr "the square that does not enable it is pinned to the frame's center time, so it stays perfectly sharp."

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:27
msgid "``set_motion_blur(False)`` 可以关闭；默认同时作用于后代，传入 ``root_only=True`` 则只修改物件自身。"
msgstr ""
"``set_motion_blur(False)`` turns it off; by default descendants are affected as well, while ``root_only=True`` only "
"changes the item itself."

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:30
msgid "快门采样机制"
msgstr "How Shutter Sampling Works"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:32
msgid "每帧的曝光区间以该帧时间 ``t`` 为中心对称分布，区间的宽度由 ``motion_blur_shutter`` 决定："
msgstr ""
"The exposure interval of each frame is symmetric about that frame's time ``t``, and its width is decided by "
"``motion_blur_shutter``:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:34
msgid "曝光区间 = [t - motion_blur_shutter / fps / 2, t + motion_blur_shutter / fps / 2]"
msgstr "exposure interval = [t - motion_blur_shutter / fps / 2, t + motion_blur_shutter / fps / 2]"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:38
msgid ""
"``motion_blur_shutter`` 的单位是 1 / fps（一帧时长），而不是秒。 例如 ``fps=30``、``motion_blur_shutter=6`` 表示每帧曝光 "
"0.2 秒。"
msgstr ""
"``motion_blur_shutter`` is measured in units of ``1 / fps`` (one frame duration), not seconds. For example, ``fps=30`` "
"with ``motion_blur_shutter=6`` means each frame is exposed for 0.2 seconds."

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:46
msgid ""
"区间内均匀取 ``motion_blur_samples`` 个时间样本，每个样本都重新渲染整个场景， 然后在浮点纹理中累加、取平均，最后一次性输"
"出。因此："
msgstr ""
"``motion_blur_samples`` time samples are taken evenly across the interval, each one re-rendering the whole scene, and "
"they are accumulated in a floating-point texture and averaged before being output at once. Therefore:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:49
msgid "只有开启了模糊的物件会按样本时间求值。未开启的物件被钉在帧中心时刻 ``t``， 但仍然参与每个样本的遮挡与排序。"
msgstr ""
"Only items with motion blur enabled are evaluated at the sample times. Items without it are pinned to the frame's center "
"time ``t``, but still take part in occlusion and sorting of every sample."

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:51
msgid ""
"摄像机也按样本时间求值。如果只移动摄像机而不移动物件， 那么未开启模糊的世界物件会因为摄像机运动而模糊（它们在每一帧的像平"
"面位置变了）。"
msgstr ""
"The camera is also evaluated at the sample times. If only the camera moves while items do not, world items without motion "
"blur will still be blurred by the camera motion, because their position on the image plane changes from sample to sample."

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:54
msgid "采样时刻按下式计算，并会被裁剪到 ``[0, duration]`` 内，避免动画首尾取到画面之外的时间："
msgstr ""
"The sample times are computed as follows and clamped to ``[0, duration]``, so that the beginning and the end of the "
"animation never sample outside of it:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:56
msgid "sample_t = t + (i + 0.5 - samples / 2) * (exposure / samples)，i = 0, 1, ..., samples - 1"
msgstr "sample_t = t + (i + 0.5 - samples / 2) * (exposure / samples), i = 0, 1, ..., samples - 1"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:61
msgid "快门长度的影响"
msgstr "Effect of Shutter Length"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:20
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"from janim.imports import *\n"
"\n"
"class MotionBlurShutterDemo(Timeline):\n"
"    CONFIG = Config(fps=30, motion_blur_samples=16)\n"
"\n"
"    class _Lane(Timeline):\n"
"        def __init__(self, y: float = 0.0, color: JAnimColor = WHITE):\n"
"            super().__init__()\n"
"            self.y = y\n"
"            self.color = color\n"
"\n"
"        def construct(self) -> None:\n"
"            square = Square(0.75, fill_color=self.color, fill_alpha=1, stroke_alpha=0)\n"
"            square.set_motion_blur().show()\n"
"            square.points.shift(LEFT * 2.4 + UP * self.y)\n"
"            self.play(\n"
"                square.anim(rate_func=linear).points.shift(RIGHT * 4),\n"
"                duration=1.4,\n"
"            )\n"
"\n"
"    def construct(self) -> None:\n"
"        for i, (shutter, color) in enumerate(zip([0, 3, 6], [GREY, BLUE, PURPLE])):\n"
"            y = 2.2 - i * 2.2\n"
"            Text(f'shutter = {shutter}', font_size=26, color=color).points.move_to(\n"
"                [-4.2, y, 0]\n"
"            ).r.show()\n"
"            with Config(motion_blur_shutter=shutter):\n"
"                self._Lane(y, color).build(quiet=True).to_item(keep_last_frame=True).show()\n"
"\n"
"        self.forward(1.4)"
msgstr ""
"from janim.imports import *\n"
"\n"
"class MotionBlurShutterDemo(Timeline):\n"
"    CONFIG = Config(fps=30, motion_blur_samples=16)\n"
"\n"
"    class _Lane(Timeline):\n"
"        def __init__(self, y: float = 0.0, color: JAnimColor = WHITE):\n"
"            super().__init__()\n"
"            self.y = y\n"
"            self.color = color\n"
"\n"
"        def construct(self) -> None:\n"
"            square = Square(0.75, fill_color=self.color, fill_alpha=1, stroke_alpha=0)\n"
"            square.set_motion_blur().show()\n"
"            square.points.shift(LEFT * 2.4 + UP * self.y)\n"
"            self.play(\n"
"                square.anim(rate_func=linear).points.shift(RIGHT * 4),\n"
"                duration=1.4,\n"
"            )\n"
"\n"
"    def construct(self) -> None:\n"
"        for i, (shutter, color) in enumerate(zip([0, 3, 6], [GREY, BLUE, PURPLE])):\n"
"            y = 2.2 - i * 2.2\n"
"            Text(f'shutter = {shutter}', font_size=26, color=color).points.move_to(\n"
"                [-4.2, y, 0]\n"
"            ).r.show()\n"
"            with Config(motion_blur_shutter=shutter):\n"
"                self._Lane(y, color).build(quiet=True).to_item(keep_last_frame=True).show()\n"
"\n"
"        self.forward(1.4)"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:67
msgid "三条跑道的运动完全一致，只是曝光时长不同："
msgstr "The three lanes perform identical motion; only the exposure duration differs:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:69
msgid "``shutter = 0``：等价于不做曝光采样，和没开模糊一样清晰；"
msgstr "``shutter = 0``: equivalent to no exposure sampling at all, just as sharp as without motion blur;"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:70
msgid "``shutter = 3``：拖影长度约为物件自身宽度的一半，速度感开始出现；"
msgstr "``shutter = 3``: the trail is about half the item's own width, and a sense of speed begins to appear;"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:71
msgid "``shutter = 6``：拖影明显超过物件宽度，开始接近\"光带\"的观感。"
msgstr "``shutter = 6``: the trail clearly exceeds the item's width and starts to look like a band of light."

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:73
msgid "拖影长度取决于曝光期间物件走了多远："
msgstr "The trail length depends on how far the item travels during the exposure:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:75
msgid "每帧位移 = 速度 × motion_blur_shutter ÷ fps"
msgstr "displacement per frame = speed × motion_blur_shutter ÷ fps"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:80
msgid "性能与限制"
msgstr "Performance and Limitations"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:82
msgid "渲染开销正比于 ``fps × motion_blur_samples × 帧数``， 每增加一个样本就要把可见场景完整渲染一遍："
msgstr ""
"The rendering cost is proportional to ``fps × motion_blur_samples × frame count``: every extra sample re-renders the "
"visible scene completely:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:85
msgid ""
"只有画面里确实存在开启模糊的物件时才会进入多采样流程； 没有任何物件开启模糊（或 ``motion_blur`` 全局开关关闭）时，渲染路径"
"与原来完全一致；"
msgstr ""
"the multi-sample pipeline only runs when there **actually is** an item with motion blur in the scene; when no item "
"enables it (or the global ``motion_blur`` switch is off), the render path is exactly the same as before;"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:87
msgid "``motion_blur_samples=1`` 或 ``motion_blur_shutter=0`` 时也会直接退化为普通渲染；"
msgstr "``motion_blur_samples=1`` or ``motion_blur_shutter=0`` also falls back to plain rendering;"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:88
msgid "预览与导出的帧率不同（``preview_fps`` 与 ``fps``）， 在预览里看到的拖影长度与导出结果可能略有差异，以导出为准。"
msgstr ""
"preview and export use different frame rates (``preview_fps`` and ``fps``), so the trail length in the preview may differ "
"slightly from the exported result; trust the export."

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:91
msgid "需要注意的限制："
msgstr "Limitations to keep in mind:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:93
msgid ""
"拖影完全来自\"在不同时刻重新渲染\"，因此对 :class:`~.Video` 这类 内容随时间变化的物件，也只是按样本时间取对应的一帧，并不"
"会额外插值；"
msgstr ""
"trails come purely from \"re-rendering at different moments\", so for items whose content changes over time, such as :"
"class:`~.Video`, each sample simply reads the frame at that time without any additional interpolation;"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:97
msgid "相关 API"
msgstr "Related APIs"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:99
msgid ":meth:`~.Item.set_motion_blur` / :meth:`~.Item.is_motion_blur_enabled`：物件级开关"
msgstr ":meth:`~.Item.set_motion_blur` / :meth:`~.Item.is_motion_blur_enabled`: per-item switch"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:100
msgid ":class:`~.Config` 中的 ``motion_blur``：全局总开关"
msgstr "``motion_blur`` in :class:`~.Config`: global switch"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:101
msgid ":class:`~.Config` 中的 ``motion_blur_samples``：每帧的时间样本数"
msgstr "``motion_blur_samples`` in :class:`~.Config`: time samples per frame"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:102
msgid ":class:`~.Config` 中的 ``motion_blur_shutter``：快门时长相对于 ``1 / fps`` 的比例"
msgstr "``motion_blur_shutter`` in :class:`~.Config`: shutter duration as a ratio of ``1 / fps``"

