#~ msgid ""
#~ "比如 ``duration=2`` 秒内移动 3.6 个单位（速度 1.8 单位/秒）， 若 ``fps=120``、``motion_blur_shutter=1.5``，则每帧只位"
#~ "移 ``1.8 × 1.5 ÷ 120 ≈ 0.023`` 个单位 —— 在高分辨率画面里几乎只有一个像素宽， 自然不会看到任何模糊。改用 ``fps=30``、"
#~ "``motion_blur_shutter=6`` 就能得到 ``1.8 × 6 ÷ 30 = 0.36`` 个单位的拖影。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "For example, moving 3.6 units in ``duration=2`` seconds (a speed of 1.8 units/s): with ``fps=120`` and "
#~ "``motion_blur_shutter=1.5``, each frame moves only ``1.8 × 1.5 ÷ 120 ≈ 0.023`` units — barely one pixel wide at high "
#~ "resolution, so no blur is visible at all. Switching to ``fps=30`` with ``motion_blur_shutter=6`` yields a trail of "
#~ "``1.8 × 6 ÷ 30 = 0.36`` units."

