#~ msgid ":class:`~.SimpleFrameEffect` :class:`~.FrameEffect`"
#~ msgstr ":class:`~.SimpleFrameEffect` :class:`~.FrameEffect`"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**半透明物件**：每个时间样本的预乘透明度颜色被直接累加再平均， 所以半透明圆在曝光期间是一条颜色一致的浅色带，不会出现"
#~ "\"叠影偏亮\"的瑕疵。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**translucent items**: the premultiplied alpha color of every time sample is accumulated directly and then averaged, "
#~ "so a translucent circle becomes a band of consistent color during the exposure instead of the \"brighter ghosting\" "
#~ "artifact."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**:class:`~.FrameEffect`**：特效通过渲染代理机制接管其关联物件的渲染， 而代理出的渲染集合会继承当前样本的时间信息， 因"
#~ "此被特效包裹的物件同样会被逐样本重新求值，颜色变换后的拖影也是正确的。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**:class:`~.FrameEffect`**: effects take over the rendering of their related items through the render-delegation "
#~ "mechanism, and the delegated render collection inherits the current sample time, so items wrapped in an effect are re-"
#~ "evaluated per sample as well, and their recolored trails are correct."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**未开启模糊的物件**：它被固定在帧中心时刻，本身保持清晰， 但仍然参与每个样本的遮挡与排序，所以模糊物件在曝光期间覆盖过"
#~ "它的部分仍然是模糊的。 这是有意的取舍 —— 若要严格还原整个动态场景在快门期间的遮挡， 需要让所有相关运动物件都开启模糊。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**items without motion blur**: they are pinned to the frame's center time and stay sharp themselves, but still take "
#~ "part in the occlusion and sorting of every sample, so the parts where a blurred item sweeps over them during the "
#~ "exposure remain blurred. This is a deliberate trade-off — restoring the occlusion of the whole dynamic scene during "
#~ "the shutter exactly would require enabling motion blur on every moving item involved."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "并没有逐物件的离屏采样。所有参与采样的物件共享同一套快门时刻， 因此无法让同一个画面中的两个物件使用不同的曝光时长 —— 需"
#~ "要这种效果时应拆成多个子时间轴，各自设置快门；"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "there is no per-item offscreen sampling. All sampled items share the same set of shutter times, so two items in the "
#~ "same frame cannot use different exposure durations — split them into separate sub-timelines with their own shutters "
#~ "when this is needed;"

#~ msgid "采样数与快门都会显著影响导出时间，正式导出前建议先用较低的采样数预览效果。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "both the sample count and the shutter significantly affect export time; preview with a lower sample count before the "
#~ "final export."
